<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA'S JSE SAYS ACHIEVES ALL-TIME WEEKLY HIGH.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA'S JSE SAYS ACHIEVES ALL-TIME WEEKLY HIGH.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said on Friday it had recorded an all-time high on the number of trades conducted in one week.</p>
<p>A total of 58,783 trades for registered for the week ending on Friday, August 8, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>The previous high of 53,796 trades was recorded for the week ending June 27, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
